    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Giraforms is a modern, block-first form builder designed specifically for the WordPress Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<p>Unlike traditional form plugins that rely on shortcodes or proprietary interfaces, Giraforms lets you create, edit, and manage forms directly inside the block editor using native blocks. This ensures better performance, cleaner markup, and a workflow that feels natural to WordPress users.</p>\n<p>Create beautiful, responsive, and accessible forms without writing a single line of code.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Native Gutenberg form builder (no shortcodes)</li>\n<li>Visual form creation directly in the block editor</li>\n<li>17 form field blocks included</li>\n<li>AJAX form submission (no page reload)</li>\n<li>Client-side and server-side validation</li>\n<li>Submissions management in WordPress admin</li>\n<li>Export submissions to CSV</li>\n<li>Email notifications for administrators and users</li>\n<li>Fully responsive and mobile-friendly</li>\n<li>Compatible with all WordPress themes</li>\n<li>Works with Full Site Editing (FSE) themes</li>\n<li>Translation ready and internationalized</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Why Giraforms?</h4>\n<p>Giraforms is built with a <strong>block-first philosophy</strong>, fully aligned with the future of WordPress.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forms are real blocks, not embedded shortcodes</li>\n<li>Works seamlessly with core blocks (Columns, Groups, Headings, etc.)</li>\n<li>Cleaner HTML output and better performance</li>\n<li>Easier customization and layout control</li>\n<li>Future-proof with Gutenberg and FSE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you already use the block editor, Giraforms feels instantly familiar.</p>\n<h4>Available Form Fields</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Text Field – Single line text input</li>\n<li>Number Field – Numeric input with min/max values</li>\n<li>Email Field – Built-in email validation</li>\n<li>Phone Field – Phone number input</li>\n<li>URL Field – Website URL input</li>\n<li>Textarea Field – Multi-line text area</li>\n<li>Select Field – Dropdown menu with customizable options</li>\n<li>Checkboxes Field – Multiple selections</li>\n<li>Radio Field – Single selection</li>\n<li>Date Field – Date picker</li>\n<li>Time Field – Time selection</li>\n<li>Range Slider Field – Visual numeric slider</li>\n<li>Hidden Field – Hidden data storage</li>\n<li>Password Field – Secure input</li>\n<li>Color Picker Field – Color selection input</li>\n<li>Submit Button – Customizable submit button</li>\n<li>Consent Field – GDPR consent checkbox</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Form Management</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>View all submissions in the WordPress admin</li>\n<li>Search and filter submissions</li>\n<li>Export submissions to CSV</li>\n<li>Bulk delete submissions</li>\n<li>Email notifications to administrators</li>\n<li>Confirmation emails to users</li>\n<li>Redirect after successful submission</li>\n<li>Form validation on client and server side</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Use Cases</h4>\n<p>Giraforms is ideal for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Contact forms</li>\n<li>Survey and feedback forms</li>\n<li>Application forms</li>\n<li>Order and quote request forms</li>\n<li>Support and help desk forms</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Automatic Installation</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Log in to your WordPress dashboard</li>\n<li>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Search for &#8220;Giraforms&#8221;</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Install Now&#8221; and then &#8220;Activate&#8221;</li>\n<li>Go to Pages &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Click the (+) button and search for &#8220;Form Container&#8221;</li>\n<li>Add the Form Container block and start building your form</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manual Installation</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP file</li>\n<li>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Upload Plugin&#8221;</li>\n<li>Choose the ZIP file and click &#8220;Install Now&#8221;</li>\n<li>Click &#8220;Activate Plugin&#8221;</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Getting Started</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to Giraforms in the admin menu</li>\n<li>Configure global settings if needed</li>\n<li>Create or edit a page or post</li>\n<li>Add the &#8220;Form Container&#8221; block</li>\n<li>Insert form field blocks inside the container</li>\n<li>Customize field and form settings in the block sidebar</li>\n<li>Publish your page</li>\n<li>View submissions in Giraforms &gt; Submissions</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"do%20forms%20work%20without%20javascript%3F\">\nDo forms work without JavaScript?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. While AJAX provides a better user experience, forms gracefully fall back to standard form submission when JavaScript is disabled.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20are%20submissions%20stored%3F\">\nWhere are submissions stored?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>All form submissions are stored locally in your WordPress database. You fully own and control your data.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20export%20submissions%3F\">\nCan I export submissions?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Submissions can be exported to CSV format at any time.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20my%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with my theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Giraforms works with any WordPress theme that supports the block editor, including classic and Full Site Editing themes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20use%20other%20gutenberg%20blocks%20inside%20forms%3F\">\nCan I use other Gutenberg blocks inside forms?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely. You can use core blocks such as Columns, Groups, Headings, Spacers, and more to design your form layout.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20do%20i%20prevent%20spam%3F\">\nHow do I prevent spam?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The free version includes honeypot protection and timestamp verification. The Pro version adds Cloudflare Turnstile CAPTCHA support.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20send%20email%20notifications%3F\">\nCan I send email notifications?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can send notification emails to administrators and confirmation emails to users.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20translation%20ready%3F\">\nIs it translation ready?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The plugin is fully internationalized and ready for translation.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20gdpr%20compliant%3F\">\nIs it GDPR compliant?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Giraforms stores data locally. You are responsible for adding appropriate consent and privacy notices to your forms as required.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20there%20a%20pro%20version%3F\">\nIs there a Pro version?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The free version covers all essential form-building needs. The Pro version adds advanced features such as enhanced spam protection, extended notifications, and additional integrations.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"do%20you%20offer%20support%3F\">\nDo you offer support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Free users receive community support via the WordPress.org forums. Pro users receive priority email support.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial public release</li>\n<li>Native Gutenberg form builder</li>\n<li>17 form field blocks</li>\n<li>Submissions management</li>\n<li>Email notifications</li>\n<li>CSV export</li>\n<li>Client-side and server-side validation</li>\n<li>AJAX form submission</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Build fully customizable forms using native Gutenberg blocks — no shortcodes, no external builders.",
    "description": "<p>Giraforms is a modern, block-first form builder designed specifically for the WordPress Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<p>Unlike traditional form plugins that rely on shortcodes or proprietary interfaces, Giraforms lets you create, edit, and manage forms directly inside the block editor using native blocks. This ensures better performance, cleaner markup, and a workflow that feels natural to WordPress users.</p>\n<p>Create beautiful, responsive, and accessible forms without writing a single line of code.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Native Gutenberg form builder (no shortcodes)</li>\n<li>Visual form creation directly in the block editor</li>\n<li>17 form field blocks included</li>\n<li>AJAX form submission (no page reload)</li>\n<li>Client-side and server-side validation</li>\n<li>Submissions management in WordPress admin</li>\n<li>Export submissions to CSV</li>\n<li>Email notifications for administrators and users</li>\n<li>Fully responsive and mobile-friendly</li>\n<li>Compatible with all WordPress themes</li>\n<li>Works with Full Site Editing (FSE) themes</li>\n<li>Translation ready and internationalized</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Why Giraforms?</h4>\n<p>Giraforms is built with a <strong>block-first philosophy</strong>, fully aligned with the future of WordPress.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forms are real blocks, not embedded shortcodes</li>\n<li>Works seamlessly with core blocks (Columns, Groups, Headings, etc.)</li>\n<li>Cleaner HTML output and better performance</li>\n<li>Easier customization and layout control</li>\n<li>Future-proof with Gutenberg and FSE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you already use the block editor, Giraforms feels instantly familiar.</p>\n<h4>Available Form Fields</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Text Field – Single line text input</li>\n<li>Number Field – Numeric input with min/max values</li>\n<li>Email Field – Built-in email validation</li>\n<li>Phone Field – Phone number input</li>\n<li>URL Field – Website URL input</li>\n<li>Textarea Field – Multi-line text area</li>\n<li>Select Field – Dropdown menu with customizable options</li>\n<li>Checkboxes Field – Multiple selections</li>\n<li>Radio Field – Single selection</li>\n<li>Date Field – Date picker</li>\n<li>Time Field – Time selection</li>\n<li>Range Slider Field – Visual numeric slider</li>\n<li>Hidden Field – Hidden data storage</li>\n<li>Password Field – Secure input</li>\n<li>Color Picker Field – Color selection input</li>\n<li>Submit Button – Customizable submit button</li>\n<li>Consent Field – GDPR consent checkbox</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Form Management</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>View all submissions in the WordPress admin</li>\n<li>Search and filter submissions</li>\n<li>Export submissions to CSV</li>\n<li>Bulk delete submissions</li>\n<li>Email notifications to administrators</li>\n<li>Confirmation emails to users</li>\n<li>Redirect after successful submission</li>\n<li>Form validation on client and server side</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Use Cases</h4>\n<p>Giraforms is ideal for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Contact forms</li>\n<li>Survey and feedback forms</li>\n<li>Application forms</li>\n<li>Order and quote request forms</li>\n<li>Support and help desk forms</li>\n</ul>\n",
